This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/validate-mutant-kills.sh, which lives in the repo-root scripts/ that install.sh never copies,
so on a consumer this fixture could resolve no subject. Its corpus, every core/fixtures/*/run.sh and the three
allowlists beside the validator, is one only this repo holds.

It is also a MUTATION BATTERY: it edits copies of that validator, sixteen times per run.
